					&lt;td&gt;libSceAudiodec.sprx&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[!Caution]
The above modules are required to run the games properly and must be dumped from your legally owned PlayStation 4 console.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
